msgid "Delete this vehicle"
msgstr "Smazat toto vozidlo"

#: app/templates/vehicles/view.html:1178
msgid ""
"Once you delete a vehicle, there is no going back. This will also delete all"
" associated fuel logs and expenses."
msgstr ""
"Jakmile vozidlo smažete, není cesty zpět. Tím se také smažou všechny "
"související záznamy o palivu a výdaje."

#: app/templates/vehicles/view.html:1182
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to delete this vehicle? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "Opravdu chcete toto vozidlo smazat? Tuto akci nelze vzít zpět."

